.TH ORO-USB 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:usb \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:usb'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:usb is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBinstallNavigatorUSB()\fR
Install the WebUSB scaffold on `navigator.usb` for the current global scope.
.br
This is the public `oro:usb` entrypoint for the downstream WebUSB surface. It returns the singleton `NavigatorUSB` instance when `navigator` is available, and `undefined` in non\-window contexts.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fINavigatorUSB \\| undefined\fR
